# comes from. Each host names its tag in its row <host>-tag, the tag that
# tools/llvm-pin names for it. The version stands in tools/llvm-version
# alone, and @VERSION@ takes it. An asset is named after the tag and the
# host, which @TAG@ and @HOST@ take. Each digest is the SHA-256 of the
# asset of that host. antic_release_pin of tools/pins.cmake reads the pin.
